      "value": "@{5aab30ea0b6da707273dbb98|full_name}: this sounds like a great idea as usually these issues are done by people who don't know what they are doing and not because they want to make a bad world, and, if people want to make a bad world, they should be allowed to. Hide it under the \"advanced\" check box as well\n\nSafety rails, for beginners, shouldn't hinder more advanced creators",
      "viewerReactions": null
