      "value": "@{5aab30ea0b6da707273dbb98|full_name}: This was exactly my thought and what I was complaining to friends about after realizing that my duck world is broken now.  \n\nIn fact, it'd be a good idea in general for future updates to prefer a safe default, with settings that can be overridden.  Blanket changes like this without the option of overriding them breaks more than it fixes. :/",
