  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-19T20:45:56.739Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Good day,\n\nAs someone that enjoys world creation with a couple of my friends. It's super disheartening to have the worlds we are making and have made to start to get limited and limited to the point that making gameplay worlds is getting harder and more annoying and more limited than ever before.\n\nOne example is our bow goblins for our SOS arena map.\n\nOld non-limited prefab spawn version:\nhttps://streamable.com/jbvrd\nNew limited one(1) per second prefab spawn version:\nhttps://streamable.com/bd9iy\n\nIt's so disheartening making complicated gameplay maps for VRchat... they keep breaking and limiting stuff.\nHaving a barrage of arrows from a pack of bow goblins feels amazing and now it's hard capped to 1 per second whatever occurs it doesn't even makes sense and destroys game balance as well.\n\nI know you want to have \"stability\" but at least allow the map makers to make that choice and not hard cap them.",
